        "original_id": "d16dd1f3-7aa6-5fa3-b7cc-492a8260eafe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lewis Gilbert, Lois Chiles, Michael Lonsdale, Corinne Cléry, Richard Kiel\n- Films: Moonraker, The Spy Who Loved Me, Inspector Gadget\n- Roles: Jaws\n- Topics: James Bond franchise\n\nFacts:\n- In 1977, Richard Kiel portrayed Jaws in the James Bond film The Spy Who Loved Me.\n- In 1979, Moonraker was the third and final film in the series directed by Lewis Gilbert.\n- In 1979, Moonraker co-starred Lois Chiles, Michael Lonsdale, Corinne Cléry, and Richard Kiel.\n- In 1979, Richard Kiel portrayed Jaws in the James Bond film Moonraker.\n- In 1999, Richard Kiel lampooned his Jaws role with a tongue-in-cheek cameo in Inspector Gadget.\n- Richard Dawson Kiel was an American actor, voice artist, and comedian who lived from September 13, 1939 to September 10, 2014.\n- Richard Kiel was best known for playing Jaws in the James Bond franchise.",
